# This wave's own internal task/orchestration log (.claude/tasks/*.md
# records the multi-executor plan, its OPEN QUESTION entries, and the
# original Windows dev-machine paths executors read reference material
# from). It documents how this repository was built, not the repository
# itself, and it is appended to rather than edited - so, unlike everything
# else scripts/publish-check.mjs checks, its personal-path mentions cannot
# be fixed in place. It never ships.
.claude/
